{
  "name": "Store Actions",
  "description": "What we will do for a store that is slipping or overdue for an audit: the cause, the plan, an owner and a date.",
  "position": 2,
  "agentPrompts": [
    {
      "key": "propose-action",
      "label": {
        "en": "Propose an action for a store that is slipping",
        "zh-CN": "为一家下滑的门店提出整改措施"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Read the `busa-store-ops` skill in this folder and follow it. For the store I name, read its signals and score, explain in two or three sentences what is wrong, and add one action with a concrete plan, an owner and a due date. The owner is the person who can fix it — the store manager, the area manager or facilities.",
        "zh-CN": "先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-store-ops` Skill，按它的规则做。针对我说的门店，读它的信号和评分，用两三句话说明问题在哪，然后加一条整改措施，写清具体计划、负责人和截止日期。负责人是能解决问题的人——店长、区域经理或设施维修。"
      },
      "intent": "change"
    },
    {
      "key": "chase-actions",
      "label": {
        "en": "Which store actions are overdue?",
        "zh-CN": "哪些整改措施已经超期"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Read the `busa-store-ops` skill in this folder and follow it. List open actions past their due date with their owner and store, and say whether that store’s score has moved since the action was opened. Do not change anything.",
        "zh-CN": "先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-store-ops` Skill，按它的规则做。列出超过截止日期仍未完成的整改措施、负责人和对应门店，并说明措施开出以后这家门店的评分有没有变化。不要修改任何记录。"
      },
      "intent": "read-only"
    }
  ],
